    "text": "Consider the hyperbola <math><mi>H</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and a circle S with center <math><mi>N</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> Suppose that H and S touch each other at point <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> with <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> The common tangent to H and S at P intersects the x - axis at point M. If <math><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is the centroid of the triangle <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the correct expression(s) is(are)"
